## Repository Structure & File Index

| File / Folder | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `reproducible_statistical_analysis.py` | Primary executable Python 3.12 script performing all data validation, FCIs calculation, Spearman correlations, Stage-1 Logistic regression, and Stage-2 Binomial GLM. |
| `Deidentified_Dataset_N303.csv` | Complete de-identified dataset (N = 303, 40 variables) with synthetic participant IDs (`P001`–`P303`). |
| `SAP_STATISTICAL_ANALYSIS_PLAN_v1.0.txt` | Formal Statistical Analysis Plan (v1.0) defining research questions, variable operationalization, and model specifications for EMHJ. |
| `STROBE_CHECKLIST_v1.1.txt` | STROBE observational study compliance checklist (100% full compliance). |
| `SUPPLEMENTARY_MATERIALS_INDEX.txt` | Index mapping supplementary tables (S1–S8) and visual figures (Figures 1, 2, 3). |
| `requirements.txt` | Exact Python package version specifications. |
| `CITATION.cff` | Machine-readable citation file format metadata. |
| `LICENSE` | MIT Open Source License terms. |

